  vendorName: Auditor Lionel
  offerText: I need a quiet place to hide these towering ledgers of embezzled funds
    for just one hour. Give me the floor space, and I will slide a thick envelope
    of cash your way.
  acceptResultText: Alistair stacks the massive books to the ceiling. You can barely
    move an inch, but the heavy envelope of cash makes the claustrophobia bearable.
  rejectResultText: You kick the corrupt auditor out. Keeping your integrity intact
    and your floor completely clear feels absolutely fantastic.
